  "description": "The E-Revox Tour Wave is a fully equipped e-mountain bike with perfectly integrated lights, fenders, kickstand and a rear carrier that is approved for child transportation in combination with a Thule Yepp 2 Maxi seat. The low step-over height of the E-Revox Tour Wave not only caters perfectly to exactly this use case but makes getting on or off the bike much easier for anyone. The E-Revox Tour is the perfect bike for everyone liking the utilitarian look and offroad riding capabilities of a mountain bike but also benefits from a low step-over height and practical features for everyday use.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX electric drive system offers powerful and long-lasting support, giving you the freedom to explore beyond your usual routes.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging, while the battery cover remains on the bike to protect the empty battery bay from the elements. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
